{"seq":2,"slug":"sources-pathways","title":"碳源与减排路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus/foundations/sources-pathways","wordCount":1356,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"碳源与减排路径\">碳源与减排路径</h1><p>同样是捕集二氧化碳，从一座氨厂尾气里抓和从空气里抓，难度差着几十倍。决定这件事的核心变量只有一个：<strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的分压</strong>，也就是气流里二氧化碳的浓度。浓度越高，分离所需的能量越少、设备越小、成本越低。把全世界的碳源按这个标尺排成一队，就能看清为什么有些项目早已商业化、有些还停在实验室——这条「浓度梯度」是理解整个 CCUS 技术选型与成本结构的钥匙。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>碳源可以按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 浓度粗分为三档：高浓度（&gt;90%，几乎纯气）、中浓度（10%–30%，典型工业烟道）、极低浓度（约 0.04%，大气）。浓度决定了首选哪类捕集技术，也基本锁定了单位成本的量级。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  S[碳源] --&gt; A{CO2 浓度?}&#10;  A --&gt;|&gt;90% 高浓度| B[天然气处理 / 制氢 / 乙醇&lt;br/&gt;近乎免分离 直接压缩]&#10;  A --&gt;|10-30% 中浓度| C[水泥 / 钢铁 / 燃煤电厂&lt;br/&gt;燃烧后或富氧捕集]&#10;  A --&gt;|~0.04% 大气| D[直接空气捕集 DAC]&#10;  B --&gt; E[运输]&#10;  C --&gt; E&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[封存或利用]\">flowchart TD\n  S[碳源] --&gt; A{CO2 浓度?}\n  A --&gt;|&gt;90% 高浓度| B[天然气处理 / 制氢 / 乙醇&lt;br/&gt;近乎免分离 直接压缩]\n  A --&gt;|10-30% 中浓度| C[水泥 / 钢铁 / 燃煤电厂&lt;br/&gt;燃烧后或富氧捕集]\n  A --&gt;|~0.04% 大气| D[直接空气捕集 DAC]\n  B --&gt; E[运输]\n  C --&gt; E\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[封存或利用]</pre><p>下表把主要碳源、典型浓度与对应捕集思路对齐，后续每一类技术在「捕集技术」章各有专篇：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>碳源</th>\n<th>典型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 浓度</th>\n<th>分离难度</th>\n<th>首选捕集路径</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>天然气净化、合成氨、乙醇发酵</td>\n<td>&gt;90%</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>几乎免分离，脱水压缩即可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>燃煤/燃气电厂烟道</td>\n<td>4%–14%</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td><a href=\"../capture/post-combustion\">燃烧后捕集</a> 或 <a href=\"../capture/pre-oxy-combustion\">富氧燃烧</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>水泥窑</td>\n<td>14%–33%</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>燃烧后捕集（工艺排放占比高）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>钢铁高炉煤气</td>\n<td>约 20%–27%</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>燃烧后 / 燃烧前重整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大气</td>\n<td>约 0.04%</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td><a href=\"../capture/direct-air-capture\">直接空气捕集 DAC</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"浓度为什么是成本的命门\">浓度为什么是成本的命门</h2><p>把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 从混合气里分离，本质上是一个逆熵过程，理论最小分离功随浓度下降而上升。理想气体等温分离的最小功可近似写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>in</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{\\min} = RT \\ln\\frac{p_{\\text{out}}}{p_{\\text{in}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.988em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>in</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{in}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是源气中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的分压。空气里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 分压约 40 Pa，而水泥烟道里高达两三万 Pa，分压相差约三个数量级，分离的理论能耗也随之拉开。再叠加实际工艺的不可逆损失，DAC 的单位成本比工业点源捕集高出一个量级毫不奇怪。这就是为什么「先摘低垂的果子」——高浓度、近乎免分离的源应当最先上马，把宝贵的捕集预算花在性价比最高处。具体的能耗与成本拆解见<a href=\"maturity-cost\">技术成熟度与成本</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"高浓度源-被忽视的-免费午餐\">高浓度源：被忽视的「免费午餐」</h2><p>合成氨、天然气净化、生物乙醇发酵这些工艺会副产几乎纯净的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，分离这一步基本是「白送」的，只剩下脱水、压缩和运输的成本。美国中西部的乙醇厂之所以成为最早一批商业捕集项目，正是因为这种结构性优势。从减排策略看，这类源理应优先纳入捕集网络——同样一笔补贴，作用在高浓度源上能买到多得多的减排量。许多现实中的早期 CCUS 项目都从这里起步，原因不是它们最重要，而是它们最便宜。</p>\n<h2 id=\"中浓度源-ccus-的主战场\">中浓度源：CCUS 的主战场</h2><p>电力、水泥、钢铁、化工占了工业排放的大头，浓度落在 10%–30% 这一档，是 CCUS 真正要啃的硬骨头。这一档内部还有进一步分化：水泥窑的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 中有约六成来自石灰石分解的「工艺排放」，换燃料无济于事，只能靠捕集；燃煤电厂的烟道气量巨大、浓度偏低，捕集系统的规模和能耗都很可观。针对这一档，工程界发展出三条技术路线——燃烧后、燃烧前、富氧燃烧，分别从烟气端、燃料端、助燃气端切入，权衡各异，详见<a href=\"../capture/post-combustion\">燃烧后捕集</a>与<a href=\"../capture/pre-oxy-combustion\">燃烧前与富氧燃烧</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"极低浓度源-大气这口大锅\">极低浓度源：大气这口大锅</h2><p>把整个大气当作碳源，浓度只有约 420 ppm，但它有两个不可替代的优势：地点自由（可以建在便宜清洁电力旁、建在最佳封存地附近），以及能实现真正的负排放——抵消那些分散的、无法在源头捕集的排放（飞机尾气、农业、历史存量碳）。代价是分压极低带来的高能耗与高成本。DAC 因此不是和工业捕集竞争，而是填补它够不着的空白，机理与最新成本见<a href=\"../capture/direct-air-capture\">直接空气捕集 DAC</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"减排路径的决策逻辑\">减排路径的决策逻辑</h2><p>面对一个具体排放源，是否上 CCUS、上哪条路线，可以归纳成一套排序逻辑：先问能不能从源头消除（换电、换氢、换工艺）；消不掉的，再看 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 浓度决定捕集难度与成本；最后看附近有没有运输与封存条件、有没有政策激励能填上成本缺口。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[某排放源] --&gt; B{能否源头消除?}&#10;  B --&gt;|能| C[电气化 / 绿氢 / 换工艺]&#10;  B --&gt;|不能 工艺排放等| D{CO2 浓度?}&#10;  D --&gt;|高| E[低成本捕集 优先]&#10;  D --&gt;|中| F[燃烧后/前/富氧 主战场]&#10;  D --&gt;|大气| G[DAC 负排放]&#10;  E --&gt; H{有封存/运输条件?}&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt;|有| I[上 CCUS]&#10;  H --&gt;|无| J[等基础设施 / 用 CCU]\">graph TD\n  A[某排放源] --&gt; B{能否源头消除?}\n  B --&gt;|能| C[电气化 / 绿氢 / 换工艺]\n  B --&gt;|不能 工艺排放等| D{CO2 浓度?}\n  D --&gt;|高| E[低成本捕集 优先]\n  D --&gt;|中| F[燃烧后/前/富氧 主战场]\n  D --&gt;|大气| G[DAC 负排放]\n  E --&gt; H{有封存/运输条件?}\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt;|有| I[上 CCUS]\n  H --&gt;|无| J[等基础设施 / 用 CCU]</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 分压（浓度）是贯穿 CCUS 全链的主线变量：浓度越高，分离能耗与成本越低。</li>\n<li>碳源按浓度分三档——高浓度（&gt;90%，近乎免分离）、中浓度（10%–30%，工业主战场）、大气（约 0.04%，DAC 负排放）。</li>\n<li>策略上先摘高浓度的「低垂果实」，把有限预算用在性价比最高处；水泥等工艺排放只能靠捕集。</li>\n<li>减排决策遵循「先源头消除→看浓度定技术→看封存与政策条件」的排序逻辑。</li>\n<li>各档对应的具体技术与成本，分别由「捕集技术」章三篇与<a href=\"maturity-cost\">技术成熟度与成本</a>展开。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"碳源与减排路径","id":"碳源与减排路径"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"浓度为什么是成本的命门","id":"浓度为什么是成本的命门"},{"level":2,"text":"高浓度源：被忽视的「免费午餐」","id":"高浓度源-被忽视的-免费午餐"},{"level":2,"text":"中浓度源：CCUS 的主战场","id":"中浓度源-ccus-的主战场"},{"level":2,"text":"极低浓度源：大气这口大锅","id":"极低浓度源-大气这口大锅"},{"level":2,"text":"减排路径的决策逻辑","id":"减排路径的决策逻辑"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"碳捕集的意义与角色","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus/foundations/role-significance"},"next":{"title":"技术成熟度与成本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus/foundations/maturity-cost"}}